  "statuteText": "265:91-e Appeal. –\n\nAny person aggrieved by a decision of the department under this section, after the administrative hearing or review, may appeal the decision as provided in RSA 263:75. The court shall have the full authority to determine whether any license suspension or revocation should be stayed during the pendency of the appeal."
